sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Monitor as Insights Zendesk Monitor
    participant Fred
    participant API as Insights API
    participant Zendesk

    Operator->>Monitor: Confirm Fred or reply switch change
    Monitor->>API: Persist global supervision control
    API-->>Monitor: Current state, actor, and timestamp

    loop Every 15 seconds
        Monitor->>API: Read open queue and selected ticket
        API->>Zendesk: Read tickets and comments
        Zendesk-->>API: Current conversation state
        API-->>Monitor: Queue and thread
    end

    Operator->>Monitor: Request Fred draft
    Monitor->>API: Check Fred drafting control
    Monitor->>Fred: Observation-only draft request
    Fred->>Zendesk: Read ticket context
    Zendesk-->>Fred: Ticket and recent comments
    Fred-->>Monitor: Draft text only
    Operator->>Monitor: Edit, replace, or clear draft
    Operator->>Monitor: Review and confirm exact reply
    Monitor->>API: Post confirmed public reply
    API->>API: Enforce confirmation and reply-enabled policies
    API->>Zendesk: Add public ticket comment
    Zendesk-->>Monitor: Updated conversation

    alt Operator escalates
        Operator->>Monitor: Choose teammate and optional private note
        Operator->>Monitor: Confirm exact handoff
        Monitor->>API: Submit confirmed escalation
        API->>Zendesk: Reassign ticket and add internal note
        Zendesk-->>Monitor: Updated owner and conversation
    end
